{"text": "At last she spoke to me, and when she addressed the first words to me, I was so confused that I did not know what to answer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She asked me whether I was going to Araby, and she said that it would be a splendid bazaar and that she would love to go. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She could not go, however, because there would be a retreat that week in her convent school. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> While she spoke, she turned a silver bracelet round and round her wrist, and the light from the lamp caught the white curve of her neck. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is well for you, she said, and I answered, If I go, I will bring you something. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What innumerable follies laid waste my waking and sleeping thoughts after that evening. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I wished to annihilate the tedious days in between, and the serious work of life seemed to me ugly, monotonous childs play. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At school I could not concentrate, and the syllables of the word Araby were called to me through the silence, casting an Eastern enchantment over me.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "t", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "s", "p", "o", "k", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "m", "e", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "h", "e", "n", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "a", "d", "d", "r", "e", "s", "s", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "i", "r", "s", "t", " ", "w", "o", "r", "d", "s", " ", "t", "o", " ", "m", "e", ",", " ", "I", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "s", "o", " ", "c", "o", "n", "f", "u", "s", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "I", " ", "d", "i", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "k", "n", "o", "w", " ", "w", "h", "a", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a", "n", "s", "w", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "a", "s", "k", "e", "d", " ", "m", "e", " ", "w", "h", "e", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "I", " ", "w", "a", "s", " 